{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14144","headline":"观卫尚书九日对中使射破的 · 戎昱","name":"观卫尚书九日对中使射破的","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛宴倾黄菊，殊私降紫泥。\n月营开射圃，霜斾拂晴霓。\n出将三朝贵，弯弓五善齐。\n腕回金镞满，的破绿弦低。\n勇气干牛斗，欢声震鼓鼙。\n忠臣思报国，更欲取关西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}